#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:77
msgid ""
"Lingua Forge is a complete multilingual SEO solution. No additional SEO "
"plugin is required."
msgstr "Lingua Forge是一个完整的多语言SEO解决方案。无需额外的SEO插件。"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:85
msgid ""
"If you have a general SEO plugin installed, this panel shows how LF adapts "
"to avoid duplicate output. The goal is collision avoidance — not "
"cooperation. LF always provides the multilingual SEO layer (hreflang, og:"
"locale, inLanguage schema) that requires knowledge of LF's language routing "
"configuration to produce correctly."
msgstr ""
"如果你安装了通用SEO插件，此面板显示LF如何适应以避免重复输出。目标是避免冲突——"
"而非合作。LF始终提供多语言SEO层（hreflang、og:locale、inLanguage schema），这"
"需要了解LF的语言路由配置以正确生成。"

#: ai/includes/Admin/Settings/Panels/CompatibilityPanel.php:93
msgid "Installed SEO plugins"
msgstr "已安装的SEO插件"

